/Title (Therepaired design is safer for 50,000 lines because it processes one record at a time rather than loading the complete file. The with statement guarantees closure even if an exception occurs. Decimal preserves currency precision, while specific exception handling prevents unrelated programming errors from being hidden. Rejected-line details make corrections auditable.)
